3. Topics must be suitable for a professional or academic workshop.
4. Prefer modern technologies, tools, frameworks, AI, automation, cloud computing, data science, cybersecurity, or other emerging trends when relevant.
5. Topic titles must be concise and clear.

Output Format (STRICT JSON ONLY):

{
  ""topics"": [
